        <h3>Nuclear Fusion Propulsion — Direct Fusion Drive</h3>
        <p>Authored an IEEE-cited technical report analyzing the Direct Fusion Drive fusion-reactor concept — evaluating fusion principles and reactor feasibility — and argued it as the most credible near-term path to crewed deep-space missions.</p>
        <div class="tags"><span>Research</span><span>Technical Writing</span><span>Propulsion</span></div>
      </div>
